### escaped space before the line end in a subshell
(cd /tmp \ 
 ls)
>>> SC1101 1:10
>>> SC2164 1:2

### escaped space followed by more spaces and the line end
tar -czf out.tgz \  
  src
>>> SC1101 1:18

### escaped space followed by a semicolon
(cd /tmp \ ;
 ls)
>>> SC2164 1:2

### clean line continuation
tar -czf out.tgz \
  src
>>> none
